Bind Npc 29014 Zone 71 for karus
Bind Npc 29027 Zone 71 for elmorad
Quest 773 "[Lemegeton] Deprived Ring"
    Journal for karus "You must deliver [Completed Scroll of Seal] to [Order of the Sorcery] Bros."
    Journal for elmorad "You must deliver [Completed Scroll of Seal] to [Order of the Sorcery] Sais."
    Collect 1 of 900294000

Requires player level >= 75 and quest 772 is completed

Rewards
    Give 125000 experience
    Give 10000 coins

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Something's up. What could it be? Go visit [Order of the Sorcery] Bros."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Something is up. What could it be? Go visit Seis to find out."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Ah..  <selfname> you are finally here."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "[Devil32] Asmodeus has been unsealed. It was my mistake. He turned himself to look like me and locked me in and he told you to go to [Eslant]. While you were at Eslant, he stole the [Sealed Ring] and ran away!!\n\nWe must deliver [Completed Sealed Scroll] to Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Ah..  <selfname> you are finally here."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "[Devil32] Asmodeus has been unsealed. It was my mistake. He turned himself to look like me and locked me in and he told you to go to [Eslant]. While you were at Eslant, he stole the [Sealed Ring] and ran away!!\n\nWe must deliver [Completed Sealed Scroll] to Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land."

On in_progress
    Say "What? You brought the [Completed Sealed Scroll]? Where is it?"

On claimable
    Show quest "You brought [Completed Sealed Scroll]? Malraseu must have known about this. I think with this we can capture [Devil32] Asmodeus again.\n\nWe now have to seal [Devil32]. But Im not sure if he's more powerful now than ever. He could have awaken all the devils to become [Awaken Asmodeus]."
